    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLuxury meets contemporary and blends with old world at Avila, the latest release in Cumnor's exclusive Convent Garden development.\n\n1 The Helm is a unique 2 bedroom duplex within the Avila development. Benefitting from direct private access from the ground floor, this home is welcoming from the minute you walk through the door. \n\nThe bedrooms are located to the ground floor and when you move to the first floor you are greeted by a hugely spacious open plan kitchen, living and dining space. This inviting space is ideal for entertaining and from here you can access the large terrace overlooking the manicured gardens. \n\nThe quality of finish is evident in every detail of these homes which have been carefully designed by Haroldo Oliveria and impressively delivered by the skilled team at Cumnor Construction."
      },
